{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-07_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-07","title":"それぞれの行動","storyCode":"4-7","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"7e851f803097c1c2bb02499a964ee5063e7bc511d6d76075a973cfe0da75f360","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ふう……ここでは、観測用に場所を確保するだけでも一苦労ですね……まさか、あんなに大勢のレユニオンに対処することになるなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……あっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あそこにいるのは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"チェン隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（どうして……？　レユニオンの死体が、こんなに……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（……まさか、これは全部彼女が……！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"キミたちか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"すまない。衝動的に動いてしまった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"これが罠だとすれば、まんまとはめられたな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"いえ、大丈夫です。現状、作戦から大きく逸脱したわけではありませんしね。……ただ、一つお聞きしたいのですが――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"先ほどの人影は……もしかして、タルラだったんでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……いいや。気にすることはない。恐らく、私の見間違えだろう。奴がここにいるとは思えんしな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、物事には優先順位というものがある。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……私が指揮を務めなければ、近衛局の任務遂行が困難となってしまうだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"特に、このような状況では……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……しかし、思いのほか事態は複雑だな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"この様子を見るに、一人で深入りするにはリスクが高すぎる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私もそう思います。ロドスとしても、チェン隊長には一度、近衛局のみなさんの元へ戻っていただけたらと。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"この場所には、天災で残された源石が無数に広がっていますから……健康体の方には、よりリスクが高い場所ですし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染防護用の道具は持ってきていますが、どれだけ持つかはわかりませんしね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ならば、キミたちはどうするんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスの作戦方針は変わりません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"確かに、龍門を守り、脅威を排除することも私たちの任務ではありますが――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我々がここを訪れた一番の目的は、ロドスの仲間を救出することですので。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちロドスは、誰のことも諦めません。……諦めたく、ありませんから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"では、私は一度隊員たちのもとへ戻り――状況が許せば、またキミたちと合流するとしよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"わかりました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、チェン隊長！　警護のために、何人かオペレーターを――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"いいや、必要ない。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あの人は、本当に強い人なんですね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――ドクター？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……大丈夫ですよ。問題はありません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"確かに、またロドスだけで行動することにはなってしまいましたが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"うつむいている場合ではありませんしね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"何しろ、ジェシカさんたちは今も、助けを待っているんですから。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]}]}
